>Davis-Floyd</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The technocratic, humanistic, and holistic paradigms of childbirth</article-title><source>International Journal of Gynecology &#x00026; Obstetrics</source><year>2001</year><volume>75</volume><fpage>S5</fpage><lpage>S23</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11742639</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0020-7292(01)00510-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gilleir</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Thuis bevallen in Vlaanderen: een kwestie van reflexiviteit (Home birth in Flanders: a matter of reflexivity)</article-title><source>Tijdschrift voor Sociologie</source><year>2007</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>25</fpage><lpage>51</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cammu</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Martens</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>De Coen</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Mol</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Defoort</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><source>Perinatale activiteiten in Vlaanderen 2005 (Perinatal activities in Flanders 2005)</source><year>2005</year><publisher-name>SPE</publisher-name><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.wvc.vlaanderen.be/gezondheidsindicatoren/ziekte/spe2005.pdf"/><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15816569</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Green</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Renfrew</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Curtis</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Continuity of carer: what matters to w